- Example #3 [ROMAN_URDU]: Customer='[Internet Sub-Agent MAKKANI-AI-AGENT-0508 • SHOP_SALES_MASTERY] VIP Client Retention & Private Early-Access Bale Drops' -> Reply='Vintage retail mein transaction close karna aakhri step nahi balki relationship ka aaghaz hai; jab customer ko lage ke seller uski specific aesthetic aur fit yaad rakhta hai, toh wo price bargaining chhor kar loyal VIP ban jata hai. | Playbook: Shagird har repeat buyer ka digital card banaye (Size + Brand + Bale interest) aur naye 45kg Japanese/USA bales unbox hone par un VIPs ko respectful WhatsApp message kare: 'Bhai aapka exact L-size Harley tee aur Carhartt jacket rack par lagne se pehle aapke liye reserve hai'.' (Action=INTERNET_SWARM_SHOP_SALES_MASTERY)
